@startuml Deployment Diagram
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam roundCorner 20
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam node {
    BackgroundColor #F5F5F5
    BorderColor #616161
    FontStyle bold
    FontSize 12
}
skinparam artifact {
    BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
    BorderColor #1565C0
    FontSize 10
}
skinparam database {
    BackgroundColor #FFF3E0
    BorderColor #E65100
    FontSize 11
}
skinparam cloud {
    BackgroundColor #FCE4EC
    BorderColor #C62828
    FontSize 11
}
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
    BorderColor #F9A825
    FontSize 10
}

title <size:22><b>Academic Event Management System</b></size>\n<size:16><color:#666666>Deployment Diagram — System Infrastructure</color></size>\n
footer <size:10>Prepared for Black Book Submission | Academic Event Management System</size>

node "<b>Client Machine</b>\n<size:10>Student / Admin Workstation</size>" as Client #E3F2FD {
    artifact "<b>Web Browser</b>\nChrome / Firefox / Edge\nPort: 5173" as Browser #BBDEFB
    artifact "<b>React SPA</b>\nVite Dev Build\nReact 19 + React Router v7" as React #BBDEFB
    artifact "<b>localStorage</b>\nJWT Token + UserId + Role" as Storage #BBDEFB

    Browser --> React
    React --> Storage
}

node "<b>Application Server</b>\n<size:10>localhost (Development)</size>" as Server #E8F5E9 {
    artifact "<b>Spring Boot 3.5</b>\nJava 21 JDK\nEmbedded Tomcat\nPort: 8080" as SpringBoot #C8E6C9
    artifact "<b>Spring Security</b>\nJWT Authentication Filter\nCORS Configuration\nCSRF Disabled" as Security #A5D6A7
    artifact "<b>Hibernate ORM</b>\nJPA + Auto DDL Update\nHikariCP Connection Pool\n(max: 10 connections)" as Hibernate #A5D6A7
    artifact "<b>iTextPDF 5.5.13.3</b>\nPDF Certificate Generation\nBackground Images\nLogo + Signature Overlay" as iText #A5D6A7
    artifact "<b>JavaMailSender</b>\nSMTP Client\n@Async Email Sending\nEmail Templates" as Mail #A5D6A7
    artifact "<b>File Storage</b>\n/uploads/ directory\nImage Validation\nMax: 10MB" as FileStorage #A5D6A7

    SpringBoot --> Security
    SpringBoot --> Hibernate
    SpringBoot --> iText
    SpringBoot --> Mail
    SpringBoot --> FileStorage
}

node "<b>Database Server</b>\n<size:10>localhost:5432</size>" as DBServer #FFF3E0 {
    artifact "<b>PostgreSQL 16</b>\nRelational Database\nACID Compliant" as PostgreSQL #FFE0B2
    artifact "<b>academic_event_management</b>\n15 Tables\n5 Database Indexes\nAuto Schema Update" as Database #FFE0B2

    PostgreSQL --> Database
}

cloud "<b>SMTP Server</b>\n<size:10>External Email Provider</size>" as SMTP #FCE4EC {
    artifact "<b>smtp.gmail.com</b>\nPort: 587\nSTARTTLS Encryption\nApp Password Auth" as GmailSMTP #F8BBD0
}

' ============ CONNECTIONS ============
Browser --> SpringBoot : **HTTP/HTTPS**\nREST API (JSON)\n`localhost:8080`\n`Authorization: Bearer JWT`

SpringBoot --> PostgreSQL : **JDBC**\n`localhost:5432`\nHikariCP Pool\n(max: 10 connections)

SpringBoot --> GmailSMTP : **SMTP**\nPort 587\nSTARTTLS Encrypted\n@Async (Non-blocking)

note top of Client
  <b>Client-Side Stack:</b>
  • React 19 (Functional Components)
  • Vite 8 (Build Tool)
  • React Router v7 (SPA Routing)
  • Axios (HTTP Client)
  • Lucide React (Icons)
  • Inline CSS (No CSS Framework)
  • localStorage (State Persistence)
end note

note bottom of Server
  <b>Server-Side Stack:</b>
  • Spring Boot 3.5 (Auto-configuration)
  • Java 21 (Virtual Threads)
  • Spring Security (JWT-based Auth)
  • Spring Data JPA (Repository Pattern)
  • Hibernate ORM (DDL auto=update)
  • HikariCP (Connection Pooling)
  • iTextPDF 5.5.13.3 (PDF Generation)
  • JavaMailSender (SMTP Email)
  • @Scheduled (Event Reminders)
  • @Async (Non-blocking Email)
end note

note right of DBServer
  <b>Database Details:</b>
  • Engine: PostgreSQL 16
  • User: postgres
  • Database: academic_event_management
  • Tables: 15 (Users, Events, Registrations, etc.)
  • Indexes: 5 (Performance Optimization)
  • Schema: Hibernate Auto-Update (DDL)
  • No manual SQL migrations needed
end note

@enduml
